        "body": "List the top 5 projects or initiatives competing for your time right now. For each one, estimate:\n\n- **Upside** — Best realistic outcome if it succeeds.\n- **Cost** — Hours per week, money, and cognitive load.\n- **Opportunity cost** — What you cannot do while this is in progress.\n- **Reversibility** — How easy is it to stop or change course?\n\nBuild a simple 2x2 matrix: high upside vs. low upside on one axis, high opportunity cost vs. low opportunity cost on the other. Place each project in a quadrant. Kill or pause anything in the low-upside / high-cost quadrant. Double down on high-upside / low-cost items first.",
