        "body": "Audit the user onboarding flow for a digital product.\n\nEvaluate each step:\n1. **Step count** — How many screens from sign-up to first meaningful action? Target: under 5\n2. **Value demonstration** — Does the user see the product's value before being asked to invest effort?\n3. **Progressive profiling** — Are you asking for info you don't need yet? Defer to later\n4. **Skip option** — Can power users bypass the tour? Provide 'Skip' on every optional screen\n5. **Empty states** — First-time screens should coach, not show blank content\n6. **Social proof** — Any moment to show other users succeeding?\n7. **Completion signal** — Does the user know when onboarding is done?\n\nFor each issue found: current state, recommended change, expected impact on activation rate, effort to implement (S/M/L).",
