        "id": "165C30D0-CD1D-472B-B251-3AB5727011C8",
        "body": "Design a loading state pattern library for a content-heavy application.\n\nDefine patterns for:\n1. **Skeleton screens** — When to use, how to match final layout, shimmer direction and speed\n2. **Progressive loading** — Show partial content immediately, enhance as data arrives\n3. **Optimistic updates** — Show success instantly, roll back on failure\n4. **Spinners** — Only for actions under 2 seconds; placement rules\n5. **Progress bars** — For uploads, downloads, multi-step processes\n6. **Background refresh** — Update content without visible loading state\n\nFor each pattern specify: when to use, when NOT to use, minimum display time to avoid flicker, and example screen.",
        "displayOrder": 0
