        "id": "B764D673-026C-4DAF-A774-CEEB70BF9103",
        "body": "Create a gesture interaction map for a mobile application.\n\nDocument each gesture:\n1. **Tap** — Primary actions, selection\n2. **Double-tap** — Zoom, like, quick action\n3. **Long-press** — Context menu, drag initiation\n4. **Swipe left/right** — Delete, archive, navigate\n5. **Swipe up/down** — Dismiss, refresh, scroll\n6. **Pinch** — Zoom in/out\n7. **Two-finger pan** — Map navigation\n\nFor each gesture specify: which screens use it, what it does, visual affordance that hints at the gesture, and any conflicts with system gestures (edge swipe for back, pull to refresh). Flag any screen where two gestures compete for the same direction.",
