        "id": "CD80D670-B057-4B55-ACC2-ADFE0EA6FBDF",
        "body": "Create a priority matrix for {{project:Q4 planning}}.\n\nUse the Eisenhower framework:\n- **Urgent + Important** — Do first, time-box today\n- **Important + Not Urgent** — Schedule this week\n- **Urgent + Not Important** — Delegate or batch\n- **Neither** — Drop or defer\n\nFor each quadrant, provide 3 example tasks and a decision rule. Add a weekly review step so the matrix stays current. Output as a 2x2 grid I can paste into Notion or print.",
