        "id": "4A12F068-8D2E-4BFC-9365-333ED1B10E56",
        "body": "Create a {{duration:30}}-minute meeting agenda.\n\nMeeting type: {{meetingType:project kickoff}}\nTopic: {{topic}}\nParticipants: {{participants:5 team members}}\nMeeting goal: {{goal:align on scope and next steps}}\n\nStructure:\n\n**Pre-Meeting** (send 24h before):\n- 2–3 bullet points participants should review or prepare\n- Any documents or links to read in advance\n\n**Agenda:**\nFor each item, include:\n- Topic name\n- Time allocation (must sum to total duration minus 5min buffer)\n- Owner (who leads this section)\n- Format: discussion / decision / information share\n- Expected outcome: what's true when this item is done\n\n**Rules of Engagement:**\n- Parking lot protocol for off-topic items\n- Decision-making method (consensus, RACI owner decides, vote)\n\n**Wrap-Up** (last 5 minutes):\n- Action items template (What / Who / By When)\n- Decision log\n- Next meeting need (yes/no + suggested date)",
