        "body": "Design a week of kid-friendly dinners (Monday through Friday) that are nutritious and appealing to children ages 4-10.\n\n**Each recipe must include:**\n- A fun or playful name kids will get excited about\n- Prep time under 15 minutes, cook time under 30 minutes\n- At least one hidden vegetable or nutrient boost\n- A step where kids can safely help (mixing, assembling, sprinkling)\n\n**Picky Eater Strategies:**\n- Offer one safe food alongside one new food\n- Use dips and sauces as bridges to new flavors\n- Present food in creative shapes or arrangements\n\nInclude a combined grocery list organized by store section. Flag common allergens with bold text.",
