        "body": "Design a 3D jewelry concept for a statement ring:\n\n**Form:** Twisting vine motif wrapping around the band, terminating in a central gemstone setting\n**Band width:** 4mm, comfort-fit interior profile\n**Gemstone:** Oval-cut sapphire, 8x6mm, prong-set with four claws\n**Metal:** 18k yellow gold with a satin-brushed finish on the band and polished prongs\n**Polygon budget:** High-poly sculpt (500k+), then retopologize to 15k for real-time preview\n**Textures:** PBR metallic workflow — gold roughness map, gem refraction/IOR setup\n**Rendering:** Studio lighting HDRI, macro lens DOF, white cyclorama backdrop\n**Export:** STL for 3D printing, USDZ for AR try-on\n\nEnsure the vine geometry is watertight for casting.",
