        "body": "Explain {{topic:quantum computing}} to someone with no background in the field.\n\nStructure your explanation in 4 layers of increasing depth:\n\n**Layer 1 — One-sentence summary** a child could grasp\n**Layer 2 — Everyday analogy** using something familiar (kitchen, sports, commuting)\n**Layer 3 — How it actually works** in 3-4 plain-language paragraphs, no jargon\n**Layer 4 — Why it matters** real-world applications and what changes for ordinary people\n\nRules:\n- Replace every technical term with a plain English equivalent\n- If you must use a term of art, define it in parentheses immediately after\n- End with 3 follow-up questions the reader might naturally ask next",
