      {
        "id": "C79A15CC-DD7F-4A9B-93F3-005B229B74BA",
        "body": "Analyze and optimize a {{formType:sign-up}} form for better completion rates.\n\nAudit checklist:\n1. **Field count** — Can any fields be removed, combined, or deferred to later?\n2. **Input types** — Are you using the right keyboard (email, tel, numeric) for each field?\n3. **Labels** — Floating labels or top-aligned? Consistent placement.\n4. **Validation** — Inline real-time validation, not after submit\n5. **Error messages** — Specific and actionable ('Password needs 1 number') not vague ('Invalid input')\n6. **Progress** — Multi-step forms need a progress indicator\n7. **Mobile** — Thumb-reachable submit button, no horizontal scrolling\n8. **Autofill** — Correct autocomplete attributes for browser autofill\n\nFor each recommendation explain the expected impact on conversion rate.",
        "displayOrder": 0
      }
