        "id": "37BBD57F-512E-4878-8D7F-17D1B8AB8381",
        "body": "Analyze common knowledge-worker tasks and design a batching schedule for a typical work week. Group activities into these categories:\n\n- **Communication** — emails, Slack, calls\n- **Creative** — writing, design, strategy\n- **Administrative** — expenses, filing, scheduling\n- **Collaborative** — meetings, reviews, pair work\n\nFor each batch, recommend an ideal time window, duration cap, and transition ritual. Explain why batching reduces cognitive load and provide a sample Monday-to-Friday calendar template. Include tips for protecting batched blocks from interruptions.",
