        "body": "Design a universal filing system for digital documents that scales from solo use to a small team. Include:\n\n**Folder hierarchy** — A 3-level structure: Area > Project > Document type. Provide concrete examples for 4 common areas (Work, Finance, Personal, Learning).\n\n**Naming convention** — Format: YYYY-MM-DD_ProjectCode_Description_v01. Explain each segment and why consistency matters for search.\n\n**Inbox rule** — Every new file lands in a single Inbox folder first, then gets filed weekly.\n\n**Archive policy** — Move completed projects to an Archive folder after 30 days of inactivity.\n\nOutput a starter folder tree I can replicate in Finder, Google Drive, or Dropbox. Add a quarterly review checklist to prune and reorganize.",
