        "id": "94684638-9383-4296-B302-7746358890D8",
        "body": "Design a daily standup framework that keeps the meeting under 12 minutes for a team of 6-8 people. Include:\n\n- **Format** — Each person answers three questions: what I shipped, what I'm working on, what's blocking me\n- **Facilitation tips** — How to time-box speakers and redirect tangents\n- **Async fallback** — A Slack-based alternative for days when a live meeting isn't possible\n- **Anti-patterns** — Five common standup mistakes and how to fix them\n\nProvide a sample facilitator script and a scoring rubric the team can use monthly to rate standup quality. Explain when to skip the standup entirely and rely on async check-ins instead.",
