        "id": "B302AE38-36AD-465D-9E4B-A6F786A6E9C9",
        "body": "Design the search UX for a {{contentType:e-commerce}} platform.\n\nCover each phase of the search journey:\n1. **Empty state** — Recent searches, trending queries, popular categories\n2. **As-you-type** — Autocomplete suggestions appearing after 2+ characters, debounced 200ms\n3. **Results page** — Result card layout, relevance indicators, result count\n4. **Filters** — Inline chips vs. slide-out panel; which filters surface first\n5. **No results** — Spell-check suggestion, related categories, broad fallback\n6. **Error handling** — Timeout, offline, rate-limited states\n\nInclude keyboard interaction patterns for desktop and voice-input considerations for mobile.",
