        "id": "14A092EE-0F1C-469B-96F9-BCBE5F86D4EC",
        "body": "Create an illustration style guide for a product that needs spot illustrations, hero images, and empty-state graphics.\n\nDefine:\n1. **Style** — Flat, isometric, line-art, 3D, or mixed? Reference 2-3 visual inspirations\n2. **Color palette** — Limited palette pulled from brand colors; rules for shading and highlights\n3. **Character design** — If humans are used: proportions, diversity representation, level of detail\n4. **Metaphor library** — Approved visual metaphors (e.g. rocket = growth, magnifying glass = search)\n5. **Sizing tiers** — Spot (64px), card (200px), hero (full-width) with detail levels for each\n6. **Dark mode** — How illustrations adapt (separate assets, CSS filter, palette swap)\n7. **Animation** — Which illustrations animate and with what behavior (loop, entrance, interactive)\n\nInclude dos and don'ts with side-by-side examples.",
